  <page_number>549</page_number>
  <running_head>PARTIS II. LIBER IV.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Tuus</catchword>
    <signature>Zz 2</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">&amp; Antipolin Navale Cæsaris Augu-</l>
    <l n="2">sti statuit, Forum Iulij nuncupatum:</l>
    <l n="3">adeo ut <i>Olbia</i> omnino pertinuerit ad</l>
    <l n="4">Partem illam Galliæ Narbonensis,</l>
    <l n="5">quæ Provinciæ nomen obtinuit.</l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Anaonem</i> Portus, M.P.XII. .......</l>
    <l n="7">Iulias Simlerus legit <i>Naonem</i>.</l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Avisionem</i> Portus; M.P.IV. ....... <i>Monœco.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>Herculem Monœcum</i> Portus. M.P.XXII. .......</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">Hæc olim vitiosissima scriptura in li-</l>
    <l n="11">bris Antonini concepta legebantur.</l>
    <l n="12">Meminerunt Tacitus, Plinius, Pto-</l>
    <l n="13">lemæus, &amp; Ammianus. Sic Strabo</l>
    <l n="14">lib. IV: ὁ δὲ ἐκ Μονοίκου λιμὴν ἐρημος ἐστιν, ὁ μὲν μεγάλως, ἀλλὰ πλάτος ναυσὶν, ἐχων ἱερὸν Ἡρακλέους Μονοίκου καλούμενον, &amp;c.</l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Albintimilium</i> Plag. M.P.XVI. <i>Albentimillum. Vintimiglia.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Consule Liguriam meam.</l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>Portus Mauritij</i>, M.P.XII. ....... <i>Porto Marifo.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">Portus non tam rei, quam nomine.</l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Albingaunum</i> Portus, M.P.XII. <i>Albingaunum. Albenga.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Vada Sabatia</i> Portus, M.P.XVIII. <i>Vadus Sabates. Vado.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">Adi Liguriam meam.</l>
    <l n="22">Inter hunc &amp; sequentem celebris</l>
    <l n="23">hodie <i>Portus</i> est <i>Savona</i>,</l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Gennam</i> Portus, M.P.XXX. <i>Genna. Genoa.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">Plene suo loco.</l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>Portum Delphini</i>, M.P.XVI. ....... <i>Porto fina.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27" para="true">Meminit Plinius.</l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>Portum Veneris</i>, M.P.XVIII. ....... <i>Porto di Venere.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29" para="true">Notus hic etiam in Latino Ptolemæo;</l>
    <l n="30">quum tamen in Græco non ha-</l>
    <l n="31">beatur.</l>
    <l n="32" para="true">Huic ex adverso <i>Portus</i> est <i>Ericis</i>:</l>
    <l n="33">cuius meminit Ptolemæus. <i>Porto di Frice; vel simpliciter Erice.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="34">
      <i>Segestam</i> Posit. M.P.XXX. ....... <i>Sestri.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="35" para="true">De Liguriæ porro Portubus sic scribit Strabo lib. IV: ὁ λιμὴν δὲ ἡ ἀρχαία ἄνωθεν μέχρι τυρρηνίας ἀπὸ</l>
    <l n="36">Μονοίκου λιμένος, ἐπὶ τὴν ἀλλὰ ἔπειτα, ἐν Ἡρακλείας ... Ἀντωνῖνος ad Etrur-iæ Portus sic pergit:</l>
    <l n="37">
      <i>Lunam</i> ad Fluvium Macram. M.P.XXX. <i>Luna.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="38" para="true">Dicebatur ab hoc opido <i>Portus Lunen-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="39">
      <i>sis</i>, Livio, Straboni, Plinio notus. <i>Lunai</i>
    </l>
    <l n="40">
      <i>Portum</i> vocat Ennius 1 Annalium, &amp;</l>
    <l n="41">ex eo Persius Satyra VI:</l>
    <l n="42">
      <i>Lunai Portus est opera cognoscere Cives.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="43" para="true">Vide quæ noto ad eundem Poëtam.</l>
    <l n="44" para="true">Portum hunc amplitudine tanta te-</l>
    <l n="45">statur Strabo, ut omnibus, quæ toto</l>
    <l n="46">Mari versantur, Navigiis excipiendis</l>
    <l n="47">sufficiat: nec solum late vasteque patere;</l>
    <l n="48">sed etiam tutissimum esse, quod iugis</l>
    <l n="49">montium præcelsis undiquaque claudatur, i-</l>
    <l n="50">deoque longissimum, in omnes par-</l>
    <l n="51">tes &amp; utrumque Littus &amp; Sardiniā prospectū</l>
    <l n="52">habeat. Silius Italicus lib. VIII.</l>
  </main_text>
